'''Theatre (Duo) Speed-Runner''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Grandmaster|grandmaster combat achievement]] which requires the player to complete the [[Theatre of Blood]] in a team of 2 players in less than 26 minutes.

Unlike [[Tombs of Amascut]], speed-based achievements for the Theatre of Blood count the challenge time rather than the overall time.

